  "question": {
    "text": "The activation energy of one of the reactions in a biochemical process is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>532611</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>. When the temperature falls from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>310</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math> to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>300</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math>, the change in rate constant observed is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mn>300</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mrow><mn>310</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow></msub></math>. The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math> is<br />[Given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ln</mi><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>]"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "1",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>532611</mn><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mrow><mn>310</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>300</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p>where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> is at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>310</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub></math> is at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>300</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mn>10</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ln</mi><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></math></p><p>So&nbsp;</p>"
  }
